thing that is not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provenance: * "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_oauth2::fapi"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses a FAPI profile on anything but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"Self::Admin"},{"type":"text","text":" (I5) — a client nobody vetted cannot be financial-grade; * the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization endpoint forces a consent hop for every other value (D4) — an unrelated party"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gets a question put to the end user, whatever scopes it asked for; * the T21.4 sweeper"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deletes only "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"Self::Dcr"},{"type":"text","text":" rows, so an administrator’s client is never swept however"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"long it sits unused. "},{"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Admin","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Admin"}],"type":"reference","identifier":"Self::Admin"},{"type":"text","text":" is the serde default and therefore what every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row written before T21.4 decodes to, which is the truth: they were all created through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/oauth2-clients"},{"type":"text","text":" by somebody holding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oauth2_clients:create"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ManagedBy"},"Self::Admin":{"title":"Admin","type":"link","url":"Self::Admin","identifier":"Self::Admin","titleInlineContent":[{"code":"Admin","type":"codeVoice"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title